{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"那一步曾救他脱离犹豫，行动明明还不够，他却舍不得松手，怕承认失望就是变心，便逼得更紧。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得松手\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想到那种不必防备的亲近，心里便软下来，却怕自己一软就停步。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里便软\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他明明受苦、也想停一下，却把难处当成还没克服的迟疑，仍逼自己往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"把难处当成迟疑\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他曾在行动中感到有力量，便要求自己一直撑住，一累就怪自己不够坚定，连歇一下都觉得不该。\",\n      \"key\": \"要求自己撑住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他发现自己明明已经累了，还在逼着一个累了的人硬撑，终于不想再证明自己多坚强。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼着硬撑\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他有些茫然，终于松了劲，却没因此安心下来，这才肯承认自己舍不得那种不必防备的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必防备的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确保留行动仍不够、舍不得放手、那一步曾救他脱离犹豫，以及怕承认失望就是变心所以逼得更紧的完整因果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R20\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化并校正前因\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他曾在行动中感到有力量，后来却要求自己一直撑住、逐渐不容疲惫并变成自我苛责的过程。将力量的来源准确写成行动中的实际感受，不再说成来自前文没有明确建立的某个决心。S02-2的箭头因此有了准确依据。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bd3bdc5d-1daa-4a3e-9a9c-227d70676c68", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T001948107217Z", "elapsed_seconds": 138.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:22:06.291930+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ef4eb0ab85ce8566e09408713355a0fc12dec75bbb10c84d2f04ee9c2f932c4f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T001948107217Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256"